Jack,

That's an accurate summary, with one correction I want on the record. We are not approving the pilot conditionally. The Reno pilot is on hold until I have the Type II report in hand and have reviewed it; that includes the test VLAN. I'm not able to grant a change freeze exception for a vendor without Type II.

I know this pushes your start date. It is the same standard we hold every vendor on that segment to, including the AMR fleet vendor.

Elena

